	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event4_enemy_4"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ロドリゲス『フッ……▼
れいには　およばないさ……
ハニーと　しあわせ　にな……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:19" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ロドリゲス『フッ……▼
礼には　およばないさ……
ハニーと　幸せにな……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:19" />
